## Architecture

```text
                    Ansible Control Node
                            |
                            |
                     SSH / Ansible
                            |
                +-----------+-----------+
                |                       |
                v                       v
              web01                   web02
          192.168.1.20            192.168.1.30
                |                       |
              Ubuntu                  Ubuntu
                |                       |
              Nginx                   Nginx
                |                       |
                v                       v
          Custom Web Page        Custom Web Page
```

Ansible connects to the managed nodes using the dedicated `ansible` user.

Privileged operations are performed using `sudo` through Ansible privilege escalation.

```text
Control Node
     |
     | SSH
     v
ansible user
     |
     | become / sudo
     v
Privileged Tasks
```

