## Playbook Validation Workflow

Playbooks are validated before being applied.

### Syntax Check

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/baseline.yml --syntax-check
```

### Check Mode

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/baseline.yml --check
```

### Apply Configuration

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/baseline.yml
```

### Verify Idempotency

Run the same playbook again:

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/baseline.yml
```

After the desired state has been reached, the second execution should report:

```text
changed=0
```

The workflow used throughout the project is:

```text
Write
  |
  v
Syntax Check
  |
  v
Check Mode
  |
  v
Review
  |
  v
Apply
  |
  v
Verify
```

