## Security Notes

Sensitive information must never be committed to Git.

Examples include:

* SSH private keys
* Passwords
* API keys
* Tokens
* Vault password files

Private keys remain outside the repository.

Sensitive files should be excluded through `.gitignore`.

Secrets introduced later in the project will be managed using Ansible Vault.

