## Purpose

The goal of this project is not only to learn Ansible syntax.

The project demonstrates how Ansible can be used to:

* Manage multiple Linux servers from a centralized Control Node
* Replace repetitive manual SSH configuration
* Define infrastructure using desired state
* Keep server configuration consistent
* Build reusable automation
* Validate changes before deployment
* Manage services safely
* Generate dynamic configuration using templates
* Detect and avoid unnecessary changes
* Apply practical DevOps infrastructure automation patterns

The final repository is intended to serve both as a learning project and as a portfolio-ready demonstration of practical Ansible skills.
